Category: IT Services 

Location: Fort Western Province Sri Lanka 

For an international organization in New York, we are urgently looking for a REMOTE Senior Angular Developer. The candidate must have 8+ years of experience building the server-side and client-side of large consumer-facing web applications from the ground up.

Candidates need to be able to work normal office hours in New York, US. Example 9 AM NY time equals 7:30 PM.

Tasks and Responsibilities:

- Work with an agile team to design, develop, test, debug, implement and maintain applications using ICT standard web-based and client-server development frameworks and technologies mainly AngularJS/Angular, Node.js, TypeScript, HTML/CSS/SASS, JSON/XML/Ajax, GitLab;

- Carry out required testing and quality assurance and ensure that deliverables meet software requirements based on agreed time frame and milestones;

- Develop cross-browser and cross-platform front-end web development including HTML, JavaScript, CSS, and the latest technologies;

- Communicate technical solutions/concepts with trade-offs, risks, and benefits;

- Develop proof of concepts and prototypes which match industry standards;

Profile:

- Bachelor or University degree;

- +8 years of experience with front end web development technologies;

- +8 years hands-on experience in converting wireframes to web pages using Angular framework is required;

- +7 years of experience in integrating front end with web services, RESTful API’s backend technologies such as C#, node.js, python;

- +4 years of experience in Angular 2+; 

- Experience in angular-CLI commands and build tools using npm;

- Experience establishing and following agile software development methodologies such as SCRUM or Kanban, with certification desired;

- Experience in branching and merging of source code using distributed source code versioning tools such as Git;

- Exposure to building application services on Amazon cloud services (AWS) or Microsoft Azure;

- Exposure for the CI/CD pipelines with automated testing using tools like Angular test tools or Selenium;

- Knowledge in Kendo UI is desired;

- Knowledge in SEO friendly concepts;

- Knowledge on configuring Angular applications for best performance tuning and security;

- Excellent knowledge of English (both written and verbal) is required;

Offered:

- A Challenging role for an international organization in New York;

- Attractive salary package;

Interested:

Please send your resume and motivation to  or call us on +94 114312515 for more information.

Details
